  "_readme": [
    "Extra trips for route-audit.py, on top of the ones in benchmarks.json.",
    "These carry no expected answer: the audit grades the app against a much",
    "wider search of the same engine, not against a written-down expectation,",
    "so only where/when is needed.",
    "Chosen for the shapes where a router is most likely to go wrong:",
    "suburb to suburb, reverse commutes, thin evening and weekend service,",
    "and the Halton feeds that were added last.",
    "Coordinates for stations and terminals were read out of the GTFS feeds",
    "themselves, not guessed. day: 'weekday' resolves to next Tuesday."
